      "phrase": "Carefully research, review, analyze, consider, audit, critique, and stress-test this end to end. Identify omissions, contradictions, unsupported assumptions, fragile decisions, unnecessary complexity, edge cases, and material risks. Then refine, simplify, clarify, extend, enrich, enhance, improve, optimize, and better it wherever materially justified. Preserve strong existing decisions, explain consequential changes, verify the result against the request, and return the complete revised artifact."
    },
    {
      "id": "ai.continue",
      "trigger": "aicontinue",
      "category": "ai",
      "enabled": true,
      "multiline": false,
